1
00:00:00,403 --> 00:00:03,445
Ariza berish bir daqiqadan kam vaqt oladi

2
00:00:03,445 --> 00:00:08,745
Kiritish maydoni yonidagi «Ilova» tugmasi bilan ilovani oching

3
00:00:08,745 --> 00:00:12,001
«Yaratish» bo'limi → nima bo'lganini tanlang

4
00:00:12,001 --> 00:00:15,131
Manzilni tanlang: kvartira, uy yoki hovli

5
00:00:15,131 --> 00:00:18,650
Muammoni tasvirlab bering

6
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,375
Rasm — ixtiyoriy, 5 tagacha

7
00:00:21,375 --> 00:00:25,899
Shoshilinchlikni tanlang. «Kritik» — faqat avariya bo'lganda

8
00:00:25,899 --> 00:00:29,533
Tekshiring va «Ariza yuborish» tugmasini bosing

9
00:00:29,533 --> 00:00:36,736
Ariza yaratildi. Holatini «Arizalar» bo'limida ko'rasiz, bot har bir o'zgarish haqida xabar beradi

10
00:00:36,736 --> 00:00:40,738
Avariya bo'lsa — darhol dispetcherga qo'ng'iroq qiling
